     "A": "NOTES"
    }
   },
   {
    "row": 27,
    "cells": {
     "A": "1. Manufacturing Lead Time is the time from production start to production completion at the vendor."
    }
   },
   {
    "row": 28,
    "cells": {
     "A": "2. Transit Days begin AFTER the product is ready in China (production completed + collected + ready for dispatch)."
    }
   },
   {
    "row": 29,
    "cells": {
     "A": "3. Total Logistics Days = Transit + China WH Buffer + Consolidation + Customs/India + Final Delivery + Safety Buffer."
    }
   },
   {
    "row": 30,
    "cells": {
     "A": "4. Change any blue number → all product-level backward calculations that reference this master will update."
    }
   },
   {
    "row": 31,
    "cells": {
     "A": "5. Prefer Subcategory match. If no subcategory match, fall back to Category Default."
    }
